        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "On behalf of the government and people of Pakistan, I extend my deepest condolences to the leadership and people of China over the tragic flash floods and landslides that struck the border region of China yesterday.\nThe loss of precious lives and those missing as a result of this tragedy evokes our profound grief and solidarity with the Chinese brethren.\nAs search and relief operations continue tirelessly, Pakistan stands ready to extend all possible support and assistance.\nOur thoughts are with the bereaved families, and we pray for the swift recovery of the injured and the safe return of all those missing."
        },
